Package: edi
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Dan P. Smith <mrdanpsmith@gmail.com>
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.com/mrdanpsmith/edi
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: Markdown editor with live preview, code, Mermaid diagrams, and spreadsheets
 Edi is a markdown editor with a live preview, syntax-highlighted code
 blocks, Mermaid diagram rendering, and spreadsheet-style tables with
 formulas. It runs QtWebEngine in a native PySide6 window.
